     "lines": [
      {
       "speaker": "Abel",
       "text": "Istvan... prettier than the reports said. Colder, too."
      },
      {
       "speaker": "Sealed orders",
       "text": "Its people vanish by night into the old water tunnels. Go below. Learn who takes them, and why. Trust no one. — C."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "layout": "left",
     "bg": "rooms/sewer_shaft_w0",
